        </div>
        <div class="floating-card float-one">🎯 <span><strong>Find your focus</strong><br>One goal at a time</span></div>
        <div class="floating-card float-two">💡 <span><strong>Stay curious</strong><br>Keep discovering</span></div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="stats">
    <div><h2>04</h2><p>Learning paths</p></div>
    <div><h2>∞</h2><p>Ways to grow</p></div>
    <div><h2>01</h2><p>First step: you</p></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="courses">
